window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Will the risk of crossing that red line outweigh the rewards? They're about to find out…</b></p> <p>CIA Color Code Johnna Red's mission is clear. She must hunt down a terrorist who is carrying out deadly attacks all over the world before the diabolical woman can strike again. Getting distracted by her handsome Delta Force Echo partner is not an option. Maybe in a different life, they could've been something. But in this life? Impossible…</p> <p>Leeland \"Nomad\" Kesling is used to running DIA missions. Delta Force does it often. What he's beginning to feel for Red, however, is entirely foreign to him. He accepted his romantic fate long ago. He knows the military life he's chosen doesn't leave room for love and family. But that doesn't stop him from wanting it… and her…</p> <p>Red and Nomad soon discover the threat they're chasing is bigger than anyone realized. Determining where the red line is? That'll be easy. Deciding whether to cross it… Well, that will be infinitely more complicated…</p> <p>Red Line <i>is an Iniquus action and adventure romance that can be enjoyed as a standalone. Happily ever after guaranteed.</i></p>"; 
